[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11460.87, "timestamp": "03:11:00", "text": "我必须做很多事"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11463.469, "timestamp": "03:11:03", "text": "嗯，好的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11466.83, "timestamp": "03:11:06", "text": "所以我不太确定今天是否应该做这件事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11469.11, "timestamp": "03:11:09", "text": "十二月初或"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11472.309, "timestamp": "03:11:12", "text": "我应该在1月份做吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11476.15, "timestamp": "03:11:16", "text": "但我真的觉得如果我继续下去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11478.19, "timestamp": "03:11:18", "text": "计划和规划永远行不通。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11481.11, "timestamp": "03:11:21", "text": "所以，我必须采取行动。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11484.15, "timestamp": "03:11:24", "text": "我想表达的是，就像那张独立照片里那样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11488.75, "timestamp": "03:11:28", "text": "目录消息采取一步"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11492.87, "timestamp": "03:11:32", "text": "向前，这是我向前迈出的一步。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11496.55, "timestamp": "03:11:36", "text": "我现在正在做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11499.91, "timestamp": "03:11:39", "text": "我因此决定回来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11508.19, "timestamp": "03:11:48", "text": "辞职？不，我不能辞职"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11510.79, "timestamp": "03:11:50", "text": "那些知道谁知道的人，他们喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11514.91, "timestamp": "03:11:54", "text": "这个梦想，这场谈话，究竟有多重要？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11516.67, "timestamp": "03:11:56", "text": "对……很重要"}]